o lets players experience the emotional journey of a struggling clockwerk artist\u2014from mockery, self-doubt, and depression to the comfort of wine and the joy of painting.\n\n\nWhat can you do in Impaso World?\n\nMake Art\n{2022076469188783}\n\nSell your Art to customers\n{26243793908547642}\n\nGet feedback/criticism by NPC\n{1479576583745257}\n\nPaint the environment\n{1571865967443852}\n\n12 environment to unlocks\n{733405433040741}\n\nCollect famous artworks\n{1900600790582959}\n\nLive your life as an Artist, from selling art in the Alley..\n{1955549118729505}\n\n.. to build your own dream gallery\n{1473366810839022}\n\nAnd.. more..\n- 4 painting modes: E-Ink, Acrylic, Oil and Watercolors\n- Realistic Oil Simulation\n- 12 funny NPC with different art preferences\n- Story Mode: 4 story act, with 2 different endings\n- Sandbox Mode: creative freedom, without financial stress \n- Paint-by-number sets\n- Commission Work\n\n\n\n\n\n{965459676127306}\n\n", "short_description": "Impaso is a sandbox Starving Artist Simulator VR Game, where you live the life of an artist - paint, sell, build relationships, take commissions, and manifest your dream gallery."}]}, "developer_name": "V.A.Q", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://notasquare.notion.site/Privacy-Policy-2a1d2dcc8f95800aa256c4134e69da69", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "V.A.Q", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://notasquare.notion.site/Impaso-Official-Wiki-26ad2dcc8f95802788e6d7b6a513f4f7", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_i